  "contentHtml": "<h2 id=\"1-paragraph-3f79\" class=\"notion-h2\">1. Paragraph</h2>\n<p class=\"notion-paragraph\">Hello World! Ini adalah paragraf standar untuk menguji apakah Notion API dapat mengambil teks, mempertahankan urutan konten, dan merender paragraf dengan benar di website.</p>\n<p class=\"notion-paragraph\"><em>Ini adalah paragraf kedua untuk menguji jarak antarparagraf, pemisahan blok, serta konsistensi tipografi.</em></p>\n<h2 id=\"2-text-formatting-3f79\" class=\"notion-h2\">2. Text Formatting</h2>\n<p class=\"notion-paragraph\">Uji semua format teks berikut:</p>\n<ul class=\"notion-bulleted-list\">\n  <li class=\"notion-list-item\"><strong>Bold text</strong></li>\n  <li class=\"notion-list-item\"><em>Italic text</em></li>\n  <li class=\"notion-list-item\"><u>Underline text</u></li>\n  <li class=\"notion-list-item\"><del>Strikethrough text</del></li>\n  <li class=\"notion-list-item\"><code class=\"notion-inline-code\">Inline code</code></li>\n  <li class=\"notion-list-item\"><em><strong>Bold and italic text</strong></em></li>\n  <li class=\"notion-list-item\">Teks normal dengan <strong>bold</strong>, <em>italic</em>, dan <code class=\"notion-inline-code\">code</code> dalam satu paragraf.</li>\n  <li class=\"notion-list-item\">Teks dengan tautan: <a href=\"https://openai.com/\" class=\"notion-link\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">OpenAI</a></li>\n  <li class=\"notion-list-item\"><span class=\"notion-color-green\">Colored text</span></li>\n  <li class=\"notion-list-item\"><span class=\"notion-color-green_background\">Stabilo text</span></li>\n  <li class=\"notion-list-item\"><span class=\"notion-inline-equation\" title=\"Math Equation\">Math</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"3-headings-3f79\" class=\"notion-h2\">3. Headings</h2>\n<h1 id=\"heading-1-3f79\" class=\"notion-h1\">Heading 1</h1>\n<h2 id=\"heading-2-3f79\" class=\"notion-h2\">Heading 2</h2>\n<h3 id=\"heading-3-3f79\" class=\"notion-h3\">Heading 3</h3>\n<h4 id=\"heading-4-3f79\" class=\"notion-h4\">Heading 4</h4>\n<h4 id=\"heading-5-3f79\" class=\"notion-h4\">Heading 5</h4>\n<h4 id=\"heading-6-3f79\" class=\"notion-h4\">Heading 6</h4>\n<h2 id=\"4-lists-3f79\" class=\"notion-h2\">4. Lists</h2>\n<h3 id=\"unordered-list-3f79\" class=\"notion-h3\">Unordered List</h3>\n<ul class=\"notion-bulleted-list\">\n  <li class=\"notion-list-item\">Item pertama</li>\n  <li class=\"notion-list-item\">Item kedua\n<ul class=\"notion-bulleted-list\">\n  <li class=\"notion-list-item\">Subitem kedua A</li>\n  <li class=\"notion-list-item\">Subitem kedua B\n<ul class=\"notion-bulleted-list\">\n  <li class=\"notion-list-item\">Subitem bertingkat tiga</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n  <li class=\"notion-list-item\">Item ketiga</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"ordered-list-3f79\" class=\"notion-h3\">Ordered List</h3>\n<ol class=\"notion-numbered-list\">\n  <li class=\"notion-list-item\">Langkah pertama</li>\n  <li class=\"notion-list-item\">Langkah kedua\n<ol class=\"notion-numbered-list\">\n  <li class=\"notion-list-item\">Sub-langkah kedua A</li>\n  <li class=\"notion-list-item\">Sub-langkah kedua B</li>\n</ol>\n</li>\n  <li class=\"notion-list-item\">Langkah ketiga</li>\n</ol>\n<h3 id=\"to-do-list-3f79\" class=\"notion-h3\">To-do List</h3>\n<ul class=\"notion-bulleted-list\">\n  <li class=\"notion-list-item\">Tugas yang belum selesai</li>\n  <li class=\"notion-list-item\">Tugas yang sudah selesai</li>\n  <li class=\"notion-list-item\">Tugas pengujian lainnya</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"5-quote-3f79\" class=\"notion-h2\">5. Quote</h2>\n<blockquote class=\"notion-quote\">\n          <div class=\"notion-quote-text\">Ini adalah blockquote untuk menguji apakah kutipan dari Notion dirender dengan indentasi, garis pembatas, atau gaya visual yang sesuai.</div>\n          \n        </blockquote>\n<h2 id=\"6-callout-3f79\" class=\"notion-h2\">6. Callout</h2>\n<div class=\"notion-callout post-callout notion-color-green_background\">\n          <span class=\"notion-callout-icon post-callout-icon\">⚠️</span>\n          <div class=\"notion-callout-content\">\n            <div class=\"notion-callout-title\"><strong>Callout informasi</strong></div>\n            <div class=\"notion-callout-children\"><p class=\"notion-paragraph\">Ini adalah blok callout untuk menguji dukungan ikon, latar belakang, dan teks khusus dari Notion.</p>\n</div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n<h2 id=\"7-code-block-3f79\" class=\"notion-h2\">7. Code Block</h2>\n<p class=\"notion-paragraph\">Contoh kode JavaScript:</p>\n<div class=\"notion-code-block\">\n          <div class=\"notion-code-header\">\n            <span class=\"notion-code-lang\">\n              <svg viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"12\" height=\"12\" fill=\"currentColor\" style=\"opacity:0.65;\">\n                <path d=\"M4.72 3.22a.75.75 0 0 1 1.06 1.06L2.06 8l3.72 3.72a.75.75 0 1 1-1.06 1.06L.47 8.53a.75.75 0 0 1 0-1.06l4.25-4.25Zm6.56 0a.75.75 0 1 0-1.06 1.06L13.94 8l-3.72 3.72a.75.75 0 1 0 1.06 1.06l4.25-4.25a.75.75 0 0 0 0-1.06l-4.25-4.25Z\"/>\n              </svg>\n              <span>Plain Text</span>\n            </span>\n            <div class=\"notion-code-actions\">\n              <button type=\"button\" class=\"notion-code-btn\" onclick=\"const pre=this.closest('.notion-code-block').querySelector('.notion-code-pre'); pre.classList.toggle('is-wrapped'); this.classList.toggle('active');\" title=\"Toggle Wrap Code\">\n                <span>Wrap</span>\n              </button>\n              <button type=\"button\" class=\"notion-code-btn\" onclick=\"const code=this.closest('.notion-code-block').querySelector('code').innerText; navigator.clipboard.writeText(code); const s=this.querySelector('span'); const old=s.textContent; s.textContent='Copied!'; setTimeout(()=>s.textContent=old, 1600);\" title=\"Copy code to clipboard\">\n                <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\">\n                  <rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect>\n                  <path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"></path>\n                </svg>\n                <span>Copy</span>\n              </button>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n          <pre class=\"notion-code-pre\" data-lang=\"Plain Text\"><code class=\"language-plain text\"><span class=\"tok-kw\">function</span> helloWorld() {\n  console.log(<span class=\"tok-str\">&quot;Hello World!&quot;</span>);\n}\n\nhelloWorld();</code></pre>\n          \n        </div>\n<p class=\"notion-paragraph\">Contoh HTML:</p>\n<div class=\"notion-code-block\">\n          <div class=\"notion-code-header\">\n            <span class=\"notion-code-lang\">\n              <svg viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"12\" height=\"12\" fill=\"currentColor\" style=\"opacity:0.65;\">\n                <path d=\"M4.72 3.22a.75.75 0 0 1 1.06 1.06L2.06 8l3.72 3.72a.75.75 0 1 1-1.06 1.06L.47 8.53a.75.75 0 0 1 0-1.06l4.25-4.25Zm6.56 0a.75.75 0 1 0-1.06 1.06L13.94 8l-3.72 3.72a.75.75 0 1 0 1.06 1.06l4.25-4.25a.75.75 0 0 0 0-1.06l-4.25-4.25Z\"/>\n              </svg>\n              <span>HTML</span>\n            </span>\n            <div class=\"notion-code-actions\">\n              <button type=\"button\" class=\"notion-code-btn\" onclick=\"const pre=this.closest('.notion-code-block').querySelector('.notion-code-pre'); pre.classList.toggle('is-wrapped'); this.classList.toggle('active');\" title=\"Toggle Wrap Code\">\n                <span>Wrap</span>\n              </button>\n              <button type=\"button\" class=\"notion-code-btn\" onclick=\"const code=this.closest('.notion-code-block').querySelector('code').innerText; navigator.clipboard.writeText(code); const s=this.querySelector('span'); const old=s.textContent; s.textContent='Copied!'; setTimeout(()=>s.textContent=old, 1600);\" title=\"Copy code to clipboard\">\n                <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\">\n                  <rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect>\n                  <path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"></path>\n                </svg>\n                <span>Copy</span>\n              </button>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n          <pre class=\"notion-code-pre\" data-lang=\"HTML\"><code class=\"language-plain text\"><span class=\"tok-tag\">&lt;article</span><span class=\"tok-tag\">&gt;</span>\n  <span class=\"tok-tag\">&lt;h1</span><span class=\"tok-tag\">&gt;</span>Hello World<span class=\"tok-tag\">&lt;/h1</span><span class=\"tok-tag\">&gt;</span>\n  <span class=\"tok-tag\">&lt;p</span><span class=\"tok-tag\">&gt;</span>Ini adalah artikel pengujian.<span class=\"tok-tag\">&lt;/p</span><span class=\"tok-tag\">&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"tok-tag\">&lt;/article</span><span class=\"tok-tag\">&gt;</span></code></pre>\n          \n        </div>\n<p class=\"notion-paragraph\">Contoh CSS:</p>\n<div class=\"notion-code-block\">\n          <div class=\"notion-code-header\">\n            <span class=\"notion-code-lang\">\n              <svg viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"12\" height=\"12\" fill=\"currentColor\" style=\"opacity:0.65;\">\n                <path d=\"M4.72 3.22a.75.75 0 0 1 1.06 1.06L2.06 8l3.72 3.72a.75.75 0 1 1-1.06 1.06L.47 8.53a.75.75 0 0 1 0-1.06l4.25-4.25Zm6.56 0a.75.75 0 1 0-1.06 1.06L13.94 8l-3.72 3.72a.75.75 0 1 0 1.06 1.06l4.25-4.25a.75.75 0 0 0 0-1.06l-4.25-4.25Z\"/>\n              </svg>\n              <span>CSS</span>\n            </span>\n            <div class=\"notion-code-actions\">\n              <button type=\"button\" class=\"notion-code-btn\" onclick=\"const pre=this.closest('.notion-code-block').querySelector('.notion-code-pre'); pre.classList.toggle('is-wrapped'); this.classList.toggle('active');\" title=\"Toggle Wrap Code\">\n                <span>Wrap</span>\n              </button>\n              <button type=\"button\" class=\"notion-code-btn\" onclick=\"const code=this.closest('.notion-code-block').querySelector('code').innerText; navigator.clipboard.writeText(code); const s=this.querySelector('span'); const old=s.textContent; s.textContent='Copied!'; setTimeout(()=>s.textContent=old, 1600);\" title=\"Copy code to clipboard\">\n                <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\">\n                  <rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect>\n                  <path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"></path>\n                </svg>\n                <span>Copy</span>\n              </button>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n          <pre class=\"notion-code-pre\" data-lang=\"CSS\"><code class=\"language-plain text\">.article {\n  <span class=\"tok-attr\">max-width</span>: <span class=\"tok-num\">720px</span>;\n  <span class=\"tok-attr\">margin-inline</span>: auto;\n  <span class=\"tok-attr\">line-height</span>: 1.8;\n}</code></pre>\n          \n        </div>\n<h2 id=\"8-divider-3f79\" class=\"notion-h2\">8. Divider</h2>\n<p class=\"notion-paragraph\">Konten sebelum divider.</p>\n<hr class=\"notion-divider\" />\n<p class=\"notion-paragraph\">Konten setelah divider.</p>\n<h2 id=\"9-links-3f79\" class=\"notion-h2\">9. Links</h2>\n<p class=\"notion-paragraph\">Tautan eksternal: <a href=\"https://docs.astro.build/\" class=\"notion-link\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Astro Documentation</a></p>\n<p class=\"notion-paragraph\">Tautan kedua: <a href=\"https://developers.notion.com/\" class=\"notion-link\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Notion API Documentation</a></p>\n<p class=\"notion-paragraph\">Uji juga tautan internal antarhalaman jika website mendukungnya.</p>\n<h2 id=\"10-image-3f79\" class=\"notion-h2\">10. Image</h2>\n<p class=\"notion-paragraph\"><strong>Image test:</strong> Sisipkan gambar langsung menggunakan blok Image di Notion.</p>\n<figure class=\"notion-image-figure\">\n          <img src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1718241905462-56e7b9f722f3?ixlib=rb-4.1.0&amp;q=85&amp;fm=jpg&amp;crop=entropy&amp;cs=srgb\" alt=\"Article illustration\" loading=\"lazy\" />\n          \n        </figure>\n<p class=\"notion-paragraph\">Pastikan gambar memiliki:</p>\n<ul class=\"notion-bulleted-list\">\n  <li class=\"notion-list-item\">URL atau sumber file yang valid.</li>\n  <li class=\"notion-list-item\">Teks alternatif jika tersedia.</li>\n  <li class=\"notion-list-item\">Caption jika tersedia.</li>\n</ul>\n<p class=\"notion-paragraph\"><em>Caption pengujian gambar: Hello World Image Test.</em></p>\n<h2 id=\"11-video-and-embed-3f79\" class=\"notion-h2\">11. Video and Embed</h2>\n<p class=\"notion-paragraph\"><strong>Video test:</strong> Sisipkan video menggunakan blok yang didukung Notion.</p>\n<p class=\"notion-paragraph\"><strong>Embed test:</strong> Sisipkan sebuah embed, misalnya video YouTube atau halaman eksternal.</p>\n<div class=\"notion-video-embed\">\n            <iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/N2FhJhJ5dNY\" allowfullscreen loading=\"lazy\"></iframe>\n          </div>\n<p class=\"notion-paragraph\">Periksa apakah sistem:</p>\n<ul class=\"notion-bulleted-list\">\n  <li class=\"notion-list-item\">Mempertahankan URL sumber.</li>\n  <li class=\"notion-list-item\">Menampilkan embed jika didukung.</li>\n  <li class=\"notion-list-item\">Menyediakan fallback berupa tautan jika embed tidak dapat ditampilkan.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"12-bookmark-3f79\" class=\"notion-h2\">12. Bookmark</h2>\n<a href=\"https://docs.astro.build/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" class=\"notion-bookmark-card\">\n          <div class=\"notion-bookmark-content\">\n            <div class=\"notion-bookmark-title\">docs.astro.build</div>\n            <div class=\"notion-bookmark-url\">https://docs.astro.build/</div>\n            \n          </div>\n          <div class=\"notion-bookmark-icon\">🔖</div>\n        </a>\n<p class=\"notion-paragraph\">Blok ini menguji apakah bookmark URL dari Notion menjadi kartu tautan, preview, atau tautan biasa.</p>\n<div class=\"notion-blank-line\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div>\n<h2 id=\"13-table-3f79\" class=\"notion-h2\">13. Table</h2>\n<div class=\"notion-table-wrapper\"><table class=\"notion-table\"><tr class=\"notion-table-header-row\"><th class=\"notion-table-cell\">Komponen</th><th class=\"notion-table-cell\">Jenis</th><th class=\"notion-table-cell\">Status</th></tr><tr class=\"notion-table-row\"><td class=\"notion-table-cell\">Paragraph</td><td class=\"notion-table-cell\">Text</td><td class=\"notion-table-cell\">Test</td></tr><tr class=\"notion-table-row\"><td class=\"notion-table-cell\">Heading</td><td class=\"notion-table-cell\">Text</td><td class=\"notion-table-cell\">Test</td></tr><tr class=\"notion-table-row\"><td class=\"notion-table-cell\">Image</td><td class=\"notion-table-cell\">Media</td><td class=\"notion-table-cell\">Test</td></tr><tr class=\"notion-table-row\"><td class=\"notion-table-cell\">Code</td><td class=\"notion-table-cell\">Code</td><td class=\"notion-table-cell\">Test</td></tr><tr class=\"notion-table-row\"><td class=\"notion-table-cell\">Table</td><td class=\"notion-table-cell\">Data</td><td class=\"notion-table-cell\">Test</td></tr><tr class=\"notion-table-row\"><td class=\"notion-table-cell\">Bookmark</td><td class=\"notion-table-cell\">Link</td><td class=\"notion-table-cell\">Test</td></tr></table></div>\n<h2 id=\"14-toggle-3f79\" class=\"notion-h2\">14. Toggle</h2>\n<p class=\"notion-paragraph\"><strong>Toggle: Klik untuk membuka detail pengujian</strong></p>\n<p class=\"notion-paragraph\">Konten di dalam toggle ini digunakan untuk menguji apakah teks tersembunyi dapat diambil oleh Notion API dan apakah struktur toggle dapat dipertahankan pada hasil website.</p>\n<p class=\"notion-paragraph\">Subkonten toggle:</p>\n<details class=\"notion-toggle\">\n          <summary class=\"notion-toggle-summary\">Item tersembunyi pertama</summary>\n          <div class=\"notion-toggle-body\"><p class=\"notion-paragraph\">isi dari toggle pertama</p>\n</div>\n        </details>\n<details class=\"notion-toggle\">\n          <summary class=\"notion-toggle-summary\">Item tersembunyi kedua</summary>\n          <div class=\"notion-toggle-body\"><p class=\"notion-paragraph\">isi dari toggle kedua</p>\n</div>\n        </details>\n<h2 id=\"15-equation-3f79\" class=\"notion-h2\">15. Equation</h2>\n<p class=\"notion-paragraph\">Inline equation: </p>\n<p class=\"notion-paragraph\"><span class=\"notion-inline-equation\" title=\"Math Equation\">(E = mc^2)</span></p>\n<p class=\"notion-paragraph\">Block equation:</p>\n<p class=\"notion-paragraph\">[</p>\n<p class=\"notion-paragraph\">a^2 + b^2 = c^2</p>\n<p class=\"notion-paragraph\">]</p>\n<p class=\"notion-paragraph\">Bagian ini menguji apakah persamaan matematika dapat dipertahankan atau setidaknya ditampilkan sebagai teks alternatif.</p>\n<h2 id=\"16-file-and-attachment-3f79\" class=\"notion-h2\">16. File and Attachment</h2>\n<p class=\"notion-paragraph\"><strong>File test:</strong> Sisipkan satu file PDF atau TXT sebagai attachment di Notion.</p>\n<p class=\"notion-paragraph\">Pastikan file dapat dikenali, URL unduhan tersedia jika diizinkan, dan website tidak menghasilkan tautan rusak ketika akses file kedaluwarsa.</p>\n<a href=\"/assets/notion/read-hello-world-RPP_Modul_Ajar_Matematika_Kelas_6_Pecahan.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" class=\"notion-file-block\" download>\n          <span class=\"notion-file-icon\">📎</span>\n          <span class=\"notion-file-name\">RPP_Modul_Ajar_Matematika_Kelas_6_Pecahan.pdf</span>\n          <span class=\"notion-file-badge\">Download</span>\n        </a>\n<h2 id=\"17-audio-3f79\" class=\"notion-h2\">17. Audio</h2>\n<p class=\"notion-paragraph\"><strong>Audio test:</strong> Sisipkan blok audio jika tersedia di workspace Notion.</p>\n<p class=\"notion-paragraph\">Periksa apakah sumber audio dapat dikenali dan apakah website menampilkan pemutar audio atau tautan fallback.</p>\n<h2 id=\"18-table-of-contents-3f79\" class=\"notion-h2\">18. Table of Contents</h2>\n<p class=\"notion-paragraph\">Tambahkan blok Table of Contents bawaan Notion di bagian ini.</p>\n<p class=\"notion-paragraph\">Tujuan pengujian:</p>\n<ul class=\"notion-bulleted-list\">\n  <li class=\"notion-list-item\">Heading terdeteksi.</li>\n  <li class=\"notion-list-item\">Anchor setiap heading berfungsi.</li>\n  <li class=\"notion-list-item\">Navigasi menuju bagian artikel berjalan benar.</li>\n</ul>\n<nav class=\"notion-inline-toc\" aria-label=\"Inline Table of Contents\">\n          <a href=\"#1-paragraph-3f79\" class=\"notion-inline-toc-item\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\">\n            <span class=\"notion-inline-toc-text\">1. Paragraph</span>\n          </a>\n        \n          <a href=\"#2-text-formatting-3f79\" class=\"notion-inline-toc-item\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\">\n            <span class=\"notion-inline-toc-text\">2. Text Formatting</span>\n          </a>\n        \n          <a href=\"#3-headings-3f79\" class=\"notion-inline-toc-item\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\">\n            <span class=\"notion-inline-toc-text\">3. Headings</span>\n          </a>\n        \n          <a href=\"#heading-1-3f79\" class=\"notion-inline-toc-item\" style=\"padding-left: 0px;\">\n            <span class=\"notion-inline-toc-text\">Heading 1</span>\n          </a>\n        \n          <a href=\"#heading-2-3f79\" class=\"notion-inline-toc-item\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\">\n            <span class=\"notion-inline-toc-text\">Heading 2</span>\n          </a>\n        \n          <a href=\"#heading-3-3f79\" class=\"notion-inline-toc-item\" style=\"padding-left: 32px;\">\n            <span class=\"notion-inline-toc-text\">Heading 3</span>\n          </a>\n        \n          <a href=\"#4-lists-3f79\" class=\"notion-inline-toc-item\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\">\n            <span class=\"notion-inline-toc-text\">4. Lists</span>\n          </a>\n        \n          <a href=\"#unordered-list-3f79\" class=\"notion-inline-toc-item\" style=\"padding-left: 32px;\">\n            <span class=\"notion-inline-toc-text\">Unordered List</span>\n          </a>\n        \n          <a href=\"#ordered-list-3f79\" class=\"notion-inline-toc-item\" style=\"padding-left: 32px;\">\n            <span class=\"notion-inline-toc-text\">Ordered List</span>\n          </a>\n        \n          <a href=\"#to-do-list-3f79\" class=\"notion-inline-toc-item\" style=\"padding-left: 32px;\">\n            <span class=\"notion-inline-toc-text\">To-do List</span>\n          </a>\n        \n          <a href=\"#5-quote-3f79\" class=\"notion-inline-toc-item\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\">\n            <span class=\"notion-inline-toc-text\">5. Quote</span>\n          </a>\n        \n          <a href=\"#6-callout-3f79\" class=\"notion-inline-toc-item\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\">\n            <span class=\"notion-inline-toc-text\">6. Callout</span>\n          </a>\n        \n          <a href=\"#7-code-block-3f79\" class=\"notion-inline-toc-item\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\">\n            <span class=\"notion-inline-toc-text\">7. Code Block</span>\n          </a>\n        \n          <a href=\"#8-divider-3f79\" class=\"notion-inline-toc-item\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\">\n            <span class=\"notion-inline-toc-text\">8. Divider</span>\n          </a>\n        \n          <a href=\"#9-links-3f79\" class=\"notion-inline-toc-item\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\">\n            <span class=\"notion-inline-toc-text\">9. Links</span>\n          </a>\n        \n          <a href=\"#10-image-3f79\" class=\"notion-inline-toc-item\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\">\n            <span class=\"notion-inline-toc-text\">10. Image</span>\n          </a>\n        \n          <a href=\"#11-video-and-embed-3f79\" class=\"notion-inline-toc-item\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\">\n            <span class=\"notion-inline-toc-text\">11. Video and Embed</span>\n          </a>\n        \n          <a href=\"#12-bookmark-3f79\" class=\"notion-inline-toc-item\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\">\n            <span class=\"notion-inline-toc-text\">12. Bookmark</span>\n          </a>\n        \n          <a href=\"#13-table-3f79\" class=\"notion-inline-toc-item\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\">\n            <span class=\"notion-inline-toc-text\">13. Table</span>\n          </a>\n        \n          <a href=\"#14-toggle-3f79\" class=\"notion-inline-toc-item\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\">\n            <span class=\"notion-inline-toc-text\">14. Toggle</span>\n          </a>\n        \n          <a href=\"#15-equation-3f79\" class=\"notion-inline-toc-item\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\">\n            <span class=\"notion-inline-toc-text\">15. Equation</span>\n          </a>\n        \n          <a href=\"#16-file-and-attachment-3f79\" class=\"notion-inline-toc-item\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\">\n            <span class=\"notion-inline-toc-text\">16. File and Attachment</span>\n          </a>\n        \n          <a href=\"#17-audio-3f79\" class=\"notion-inline-toc-item\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\">\n            <span class=\"notion-inline-toc-text\">17. Audio</span>\n          </a>\n        \n          <a href=\"#18-table-of-contents-3f79\" class=\"notion-inline-toc-item\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\">\n            <span class=\"notion-inline-toc-text\">18. Table of Contents</span>\n          </a>\n        \n          <a href=\"#19-columns-3f79\" class=\"notion-inline-toc-item\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\">\n            <span class=\"notion-inline-toc-text\">19. Columns</span>\n          </a>\n        \n          <a href=\"#20-child-page-3f79\" class=\"notion-inline-toc-item\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\">\n            <span class=\"notion-inline-toc-text\">20. Child Page</span>\n          </a>\n        \n          <a href=\"#21-unsupported-block-test-3f79\" class=\"notion-inline-toc-item\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\">\n            <span class=\"notion-inline-toc-text\">21. Unsupported Block Test</span>\n          </a>\n        \n          <a href=\"#22-empty-content-test-3f79\" class=\"notion-inline-toc-item\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\">\n            <span class=\"notion-inline-toc-text\">22. Empty Content Test</span>\n          </a>\n        \n          <a href=\"#23-final-validation-3f79\" class=\"notion-inline-toc-item\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\">\n            <span class=\"notion-inline-toc-text\">23. Final Validation</span>\n          </a>\n        \n          <a href=\"#conclusion-3f79\" class=\"notion-inline-toc-item\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\">\n            <span class=\"notion-inline-toc-text\">Conclusion</span>\n          </a>\n        </nav>\n<h2 id=\"19-columns-3f79\" class=\"notion-h2\">19. Columns</h2>\n<p class=\"notion-paragraph\"><strong>Kolom kiri</strong></p>\n<p class=\"notion-paragraph\">Ini adalah konten kolom kiri untuk menguji tata letak multi-kolom.</p>\n<div class=\"notion-column-list\"><div class=\"notion-column\"><p class=\"notion-paragraph\"><strong>Kolom kiri</strong></p>\n<p class=\"notion-paragraph\">Ini adalah konten kolom kiri untuk menguji apakah urutan dan struktur kolom tetap konsisten setelah proses ekspor.</p>\n</div><div class=\"notion-column\"><p class=\"notion-paragraph\"><strong>Kolom kanan</strong></p>\n<p class=\"notion-paragraph\">Ini adalah konten kolom kanan untuk menguji apakah urutan dan struktur kolom tetap konsisten setelah proses ekspor.</p>\n</div></div>\n<h2 id=\"20-child-page-3f79\" class=\"notion-h2\">20. Child Page</h2>\n<p class=\"notion-paragraph\">Jika tersedia, sisipkan blok tautan menuju halaman anak Notion.</p>\n<p class=\"notion-paragraph\">Uji apakah halaman anak diabaikan, diubah menjadi tautan, atau ikut diproses sebagai konten terpisah sesuai konfigurasi SSG.</p>\n<h2 id=\"21-unsupported-block-test-3f79\" class=\"notion-h2\">21. Unsupported Block Test</h2>\n<p class=\"notion-paragraph\">Tambahkan beberapa blok Notion lain yang tersedia di workspace, misalnya:</p>\n<ul class=\"notion-bulleted-list\">\n  <li class=\"notion-list-item\">Synced block</li>\n  <li class=\"notion-list-item\">Table of contents</li>\n  <li class=\"notion-list-item\">Breadcrumb</li>\n  <li class=\"notion-list-item\">Link preview</li>\n  <li class=\"notion-list-item\">Database view</li>\n  <li class=\"notion-list-item\">Button</li>\n  <li class=\"notion-list-item\">Chart, jika tersedia</li>\n</ul>\n<p class=\"notion-paragraph\">Tujuan bagian ini adalah mendeteksi blok yang belum didukung dan memastikan sistem tidak gagal membangun seluruh website hanya karena satu blok tidak dikenal.</p>\n<h2 id=\"22-empty-content-test-3f79\" class=\"notion-h2\">22. Empty Content Test</h2>\n<p class=\"notion-paragraph\">Paragraf sebelum blok kosong.</p>\n<p class=\"notion-paragraph\">Paragraf setelah blok kosong.</p>\n<p class=\"notion-paragraph\">Bagian ini digunakan untuk menguji perilaku sistem saat menghadapi blok kosong atau konten yang tidak memiliki teks.</p>\n<h2 id=\"23-final-validation-3f79\" class=\"notion-h2\">23. Final Validation</h2>\n<p class=\"notion-paragraph\">Checklist pengujian:</p>\n<ul class=\"notion-bulleted-list\">\n  <li class=\"notion-list-item\">Semua blok berhasil diambil dari Notion.</li>\n  <li class=\"notion-list-item\">Urutan blok tetap sama.</li>\n  <li class=\"notion-list-item\">Heading menghasilkan struktur HTML yang benar.</li>\n  <li class=\"notion-list-item\">Format teks tetap dipertahankan.</li>\n  <li class=\"notion-list-item\">Gambar dan file dapat diakses.</li>\n  <li class=\"notion-list-item\">Tabel tidak rusak pada layar kecil.</li>\n  <li class=\"notion-list-item\">Kode ditampilkan tanpa kehilangan indentasi.</li>\n  <li class=\"notion-list-item\">Tautan eksternal berfungsi.</li>\n  <li class=\"notion-list-item\">Blok yang tidak didukung memiliki fallback.</li>\n  <li class=\"notion-list-item\">Tidak ada error saat proses build.</li>\n  <li class=\"notion-list-item\">Output HTML valid dan responsif.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"conclusion-3f79\" class=\"notion-h2\">Conclusion</h2>\n<p class=\"notion-paragraph\">Hello World! Jika seluruh bagian berhasil diproses, integrasi Notion → SSG → HTML telah melewati pengujian dasar struktur konten.</p>\n<p class=\"notion-paragraph\">Namun, hasil yang benar-benar lulus baru dapat dipastikan setelah konten diambil melalui Notion API, dikonversi oleh pipeline SSG, lalu diperiksa pada HTML hasil build.</p>\n<p class=\"notion-paragraph\"><strong>End of Test Article</strong></p>\n",
